        "Content": "Hall - 5.27m x 2.99m \r\nAn exceptionally large hall with access to all 3 reception rooms.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.34m x 3.92m \r\nA beautiful south facing room with a feature fireplace and double doors leading to the dining room. \r\n\r\nDining Room - 4.65m x 3.77m \r\nA very large dining room with the fireplace removed.\r\n\r\nFamily Room - 4.61m x 3.23m \r\nPositioned off the kitchen with access leading to the 4th bedroom and WC off.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.59m x 3.11m \r\nFitted kitchen units with patio door access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C. - 2.0m x 0.87m \r\nFully fitted with seperate access.\r\n\r\nBedroom Four - 5.76m x 2.59m \r\nA garage converted bedroom.\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.55m x 1.79m \r\nA very large bright landing with a window to the side.\r\n\r\nBedroom One - 4.32m x 3.36m \r\nA large double bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two - 3.71m x 3.24m \r\nA large double bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three - 2.85m x 2.69m \r\nA very good size 3rd bedroom overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.85m x 1.69m \r\nA fully fitted barthroom with a large curved shower.\r\n\r\n"
